  "description": "Easy-to-use cryptographic library: AES-GCM and ChaCha20-Poly1305 (AEAD), RSA-OAEP, RSA-PSS and ECDSA signatures, hashes and HMAC (MD5/SHA1/SHA2), PBKDF2, Argon2id and HKDF key derivation, self-contained password hashing (PHC format), password-based and chunked file encryption, DPAPI wrapper, Base64/Base64Url/Base32/Hexadecimal encoders. Works with .NET Framework 4.6.1+, .NET (Core) 2.0+, .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
