  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Targets: .NET Standard 2.0/2.1, .NET 8 and .NET 10\n- AEAD: AES-GCM (128/192/256, with associated data) and ChaCha20-Poly1305\n- Asymmetric: RSA-OAEP encryption, RSA-PSS and ECDSA signatures, PEM key pair generation\n- Hash and HMAC: MD5, SHA1, SHA256, SHA384, SHA512 (data/text/file, sync and async)\n- Key derivation: PBKDF2, Argon2id, HKDF\n- Password hashing (PHC self-contained format) and password-based encryption\n- Chunked file encryption with progress and cancellation\n- DataProtection (Windows DPAPI wrapper)\n- Encoders: Base64, Base64Url, Base32, Hexadecimal\n- Symmetric key generation helper (cryptographically secure random)",
